<title>USA: TENNIS-HINGIS BEATS SELES FOR SIXTH TITLE OF YEAR. [CORRECTED 23:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HINGIS BEATS SELES FOR SIXTH TITLE OF YEAR. [CORRECTED 23:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>HILTON HEAD ISLAND, South Carolina 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline from &quot;Hilton Head Island women's results.&quot;)</p>
<p>Result from $926,250 Family Circle Cup women's tennis</p>
<p>tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat 4-Monica Seles (U.S.) 3-6</p>
<p>6-3 7-6 (7-5)</p>
